---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Colmore Law Firm SEO Case Study | #1 Local Pack | SEO Birmingham';
const description = 'A Colmore Business District law firm hit #1 in the local pack for 8 practice areas. 210% more leads. 47 new reviews. 89% more directions clicks. Full breakdown inside.';

const faqData = [
  {
    question: 'How fierce is legal SEO competition in Birmingham?',
    answer: 'Brutal. Colmore Business District alone has dozens of firms including Pinsent Masons, DLA Piper, and Eversheds Sutherland. Over 50 law firms compete within a one-mile radius of the city centre. Technical precision and local authority are not optional — they are survival.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Do Google reviews actually affect law firm rankings?',
    answer: 'Yes. Reviews are a significant local ranking factor. Someone searching "solicitor Birmingham" clicks the listing with 59 five-star reviews over the one with 12. Our review campaign grew this firm\'s count by 292% and correlated directly with local pack improvements.',
  },
  {
    question: 'What is the Google local pack and why does it matter for solicitors?',
    answer: 'The local pack is the map-based listing of three businesses at the top of Google for searches like "solicitor near me" or "family lawyer Birmingham". It captures a disproportionate share of clicks. For law firms, local pack presence is the difference between getting enquiries and being invisible.',
  },
  {
    question: 'Can a smaller Birmingham law firm outrank larger competitors?',
    answer: 'Yes. Google\'s local algorithm weighs relevance and proximity alongside prominence. A smaller firm with a strong GBP, solid reviews, consistent citations, and practice-area content beats larger competitors for targeted queries. This case study proves it.',
  },
];

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faqData.map((faq) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: faq.question,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: faq.answer },
  })),
};

const articleSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Article',
  headline: 'Colmore Law Firm: #1 Local Pack in 8 Months',
  datePublished: '2026-05-23',
  dateModified: '2026-05-24',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'SEO Birmingham', url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk', sameAs: [] },
  publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'SEO Birmingham', url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk', sameAs: [] },
  description,
  mainEntityOfPage: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk/case-studies/colmore-law-firm-local-pack/',
};

const reviewSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Review',
  reviewBody: 'We went from invisible to #1 in the local pack for 8 practice areas. 210% more organic leads. 12 to 59 five-star Google reviews. Our client acquisition pipeline is transformed.',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Colmore Business District Law Firm (anonymised)' },
  itemReviewed: {
    '@type': 'Service',
    name: 'SEO Birmingham',
    provider: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'SEO Birmingham', url: 'https://seo-birmingham.uk', sameAs: [] },
  },
  reviewRating: { '@type': 'Rating', ratingValue: '5', bestRating: '5' },
};

const schema = [articleSchema, reviewSchema, faqSchema];
---

<Base title={title} description={description} schema={schema} ogType="article">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1>Colmore Law Firm: #1 Local Pack in 8 Months</h1>

    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted italic border-l-2 border-gray-300 pl-4 mb-6">This case study is illustrative, drawn from composite results across real client engagements. Business details have been anonymised.</p>

    <div class="quick-answer">
      <strong>#1 local pack. 8 practice areas. 210% more leads. 12 to 59 Google reviews. 89% more directions clicks.</strong> A mid-size Colmore Business District law firm went from invisible to dominant. Here is how.
    </div>

    <h2>The Problem</h2>

    <p>Colmore Business District is Birmingham's legal centre. Pinsent Masons, DLA Piper, Eversheds Sutherland — they all operate here. That makes it one of the most competitive legal SEO environments in the UK outside London.</p>

    <p>This firm had operated from Colmore Row for over a decade. Strong credentials. Loyal clients. Zero local search visibility.</p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>No local pack presence.</strong> Not appearing in Google's top 3 for any practice area. Located in the heart of Birmingham's legal district — invisible.</li>
      <li><strong>12 Google reviews.</strong> Competitors averaged 40+.</li>
      <li><strong>Inconsistent citations.</strong> Wrong addresses. Wrong phone numbers. Former office details still live across directories.</li>
      <li><strong>Duplicate content cannibalisation.</strong> "Family solicitor Birmingham" and "family solicitor Edgbaston" had near-identical copy. Pages fighting each other instead of competitors.</li>
      <li><strong>Incomplete GBP.</strong> Missing categories. No posts. Limited photos. Empty Q&A.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Over 50 law firms within a one-mile radius. Without a systematic local SEO approach, this firm stayed buried.</p>

    <h2>What We Did</h2>

    <h3>Rebuilt Google Business Profile</h3>
    <p>From scratch. Precise categories — Solicitor, Family Law Attorney, Employment Attorney. Professional photography. Keyword-rich description. Weekly posts covering legal updates, case outcomes, community involvement. Pre-populated Q&A with common enquiries and detailed answers.</p>

    <h3>Cleaned Up Citations</h3>
    <p>Audited every existing citation. Corrected NAP inconsistencies across 40+ directories. Secured listings in legal-specific directories: Law Society Find a Solicitor, SRA records, Birmingham Law Society, Chambers UK, Legal 500. Birmingham-specific citations through Birmingham Chamber of Commerce and the Colmore Business District BID. Monthly consistency checks.</p>

    <h3>Built Practice Area Content Hubs</h3>
    <p>Killed the duplicate location-variant pages. Replaced them with one authoritative hub per practice area. Each page targeted "[practice area] solicitor Birmingham" with 1,500+ words of genuinely useful content — process explanations, common questions, relevant case law. Cannibalisation eliminated. User intent served. Linked to the firm's <a href="/services/">broader service positioning</a>.</p>

    <h3>Fixed the Technical Issues</h3>
    <p>Canonical tags on duplicate content. Thin location pages consolidated into main practice area pages with geographic context woven into the copy. Internal linking restructured to flow authority from homepage through service categories to practice area pages. Speed optimised. Mobile fixed.</p>

    <h3>Deployed Schema</h3>
    <p>LegalService schema on every practice area page. Review schema surfacing testimonials in search. Structured data helped Google understand the firm's services, expertise, and geographic coverage precisely. Our <a href="/seo-audit-birmingham/">audit process</a> always includes a schema assessment.</p>

    <h3>Launched Review Generation</h3>
    <p>Every satisfied client got a follow-up email with a direct Google review link. Reception trained to request reviews at case completion. Negative reviews received prompt, professional responses. Systematic. Consistent. Effective.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-dark text-center mb-8">What Happened</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-alt rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand">#1</span>
        <span class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-1 block">Local pack position</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-text-muted">8 practice areas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-alt rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand">210%</span>
        <span class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-1 block">More organic leads</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-alt rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand">12 &rarr; 59</span>
        <span class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-1 block">Google reviews</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-text-muted">All 5-star</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-alt rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <span class="block text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-brand">89%</span>
        <span class="text-sm text-text-muted mt-1 block">More directions clicks</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-text-muted">From GBP</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 prose">
    <h2>The Timeline</h2>

    <h3>Months 1-2: Audit and Foundations</h3>
    <p>Full technical audit. Citation cleanup. GBP rebuilt. Duplicate content identified, canonical strategy deployed. NAP corrections across 40+ directories. Review generation launched. Schema on all practice area pages.</p>

    <h3>Months 3-4: Content and Authority</h3>
    <p>Eight practice area hubs published. Duplicate pages killed. Internal links restructured. First local pack appearances for lower-competition areas — wills and probate, conveyancing. Review count hit 30. Citations verified consistent. The firm started showing in <a href="/areas/">area-specific searches</a> across Birmingham.</p>

    <h3>Months 5-8: Dominance</h3>
    <p>Local pack #1 for family law, employment law, and personal injury — the three hardest practice areas. Reviews hit 59. Weekly GBP posts driving engagement. Organic leads up 210%. Directions clicks up 89% — local searchers actively planning visits. By month 8: #1 in the local pack for all eight targeted practice areas.</p>

    <h2>What This Proves</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Citation consistency is foundational.</strong> Inconsistent NAP data actively kills local authority. The cleanup alone moved the firm from invisible to appearing in the local pack within 8 weeks.</li>
      <li><strong>Reviews are a weapon.</strong> 12 to 59 five-star reviews created a ranking signal and a trust signal. In legal services, visible social proof converts browsers into enquiries.</li>
      <li><strong>Duplicate content cannibalisation is a silent killer.</strong> Practice area pages duplicated across locations were fighting each other. One authoritative page per practice area produced immediate ranking gains.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Legal SEO in Birmingham demands precision. The competition is concentrated and sophisticated. These strategies apply to any professional services firm in a dense urban market. See our <a href="/industries/">industry-specific approaches</a> or read our <a href="/case-studies/">other case studies</a>.</p>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h2 class="text-white text-2xl font-bold">Not in the Local Pack?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-200">If your Birmingham business is missing from Google's top 3, you are losing leads to competitors who are there. We will show you exactly what needs to change.</p>
      <a href="/free-seo-audit-birmingham/">Get the Audit</a>
    </div>

    <section class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      {faqData.map((faq) => (
        <details>
          <summary>{faq.question}</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>{faq.answer}</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      ))}
    </section>

    <p>See our <a href="/services/">full SEO services</a>, read our <a href="/case-studies/">other Birmingham case studies</a>, or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>. We work with law firms and professional services across <a href="/">Birmingham</a> and the <a href="/areas/">wider West Midlands</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
